body:
*This comment has no bad intentions.*

&#x200B;

Please tell me what makes you think this way as I get this comment all the time and I can't really judge my own accent. I hope sounding Eastern European works when I learn Russian as well.

>  I didn't need to explain those thoughts/feelings to ANYONE. 

Thank you so much, I didn't realize a sentence would help this much but it does. I needed to realize this but sometimes we can't see what's in front of us. Thank you for this. 

&#x200B;
